{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_109_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，壬午，陳侯朔卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"三、邾子蘧篨卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"四、自正月不雨，至於秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"五、大室屋壞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"大室屋壞者，有壞道也，譏不修也。大室猶世室也。周公曰大廟，伯禽曰大室，群公曰宮。禮，宗廟之事，君親割，夫人親舂，敬之至也。為社稷之主，而先君之廟壞，極稱之，志不敬也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。衞侯會公於沓。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"七、狄侵衞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"八、十有二月，乙丑，公及晉侯盟。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"九、公還自晉，鄭伯會公於棐。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_109_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_109","textTraditional":"還者，事未畢也，自晉事畢也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}